  summary: 
  entries:
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Hello Sans
    Timestamp: 40588.168
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: Oh, a new face! Or should I say, a new skull? Ha ha, I'm Sans, the skeleton
      with a sense of humor! What brings you to this neck of the woods?
    Timestamp: 40819.324
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: I like this graveyard
    Timestamp: 42092.465
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: Ah, a graveyard, eh? Well, I've got a bone to pick with this place! Get
      it? Bone? Ha ha ha, oh boy, I'm on fire today! What's the dealio, player friend?
      You like cemeteries or something?
    Timestamp: 42602.348
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: 'HAHAHAHAHAH you are so funny '
    Timestamp: 44339.387
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: '{"Ha! Thanks, friend! I''ve got a million of ''em. Want to hear one about
      why the skeleton refused to go to the party?"}'
    Timestamp: 44694.13
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Okey tell me
    Timestamp: 45775.844
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Tell me the joke come on
    Timestamp: 46835.023
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: Why did the skeleton refuse to run for president? Because he had no body
      to back his campaign! Haha, see what I did there?!
    Timestamp: 47299.348
