  m_Name: Conversation_cc02df3c
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  loadMode: 0
  saveMode: 0
  saveInterval: 120
  subFolder: Characters\Sans\Conversations\Player
  maxEntries: 10
  summary: 
  entries:
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Hello Sans
    Timestamp: 41428.344
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: Ah, a new friend! Welcome to my show, partner! *chuckles* I've got a million
      of 'em... okay, maybe not a million, but definitely a few that'll make your
      bones ache from laughing too hard! What's on your mind, Player? Need some comedy
      therapy or just looking for some good old-fashioned belly laughs?
    Timestamp: 41853.77
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: You seem, pretty dead men.
    Timestamp: 43548.637
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: Well, that's a new one! I've been called many things in my time, but 'pretty
      dead men'? That's a real... um... bone-ified compliment!
    Timestamp: 43850.957
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: HAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHHA, good one
    Timestamp: 45353.29
  - Speaker: Sans
    Text: Hehe, glad I could bring a smile to your face! But don't get too comfortable,
      folks. Laughter is the best medicine, after all... unless you have a rare condition,
      of course.
    Timestamp: 45598.914
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: See you later!
    Timestamp: 47070.145
